<Base title="Play"><header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">Go on, have a look around</p><h1>Play the current build</h1><p class="lead">The playable copy follows Davy from the hospital through the roadside, museum, and service tunnels to a final choice. It is still a work in progress, but the desktop campaign and both endings are in place.</p><p class="actions"><a class="button" href="/game/">Launch the game</a></p></header><section class="section split"><div><h2>What you can do</h2><p>Move, aim, fire the two-shell shotgun, and reload it one shell at a time. Fight through the route, look for clues, handle the museum encounter by force or recall, and decide what happens at the final radio. Chapter checkpoints offer Continue after a reload.</p><p>The game also keeps the room destruction, first-person raccoon view, and graphics settings from the earlier prototype. Later work includes expanded audio, optional content, more detailed gore, and additional scene polish.</p></div><div><h2>Desktop controls</h2><p>WASD move · Mouse look · Right mouse aim · Left mouse fire · R reload · Shift sprint · Space hop · Q raccoon · Esc release mouse. The standalone game includes an optional touch overlay, retained from earlier work, but phone support is not part of the current finishing scope.</p></div></section></Base>
